    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "** VIEWING Saturday 5th October 2026, 1pm - 1:20pm ***\r\n      Call/Text Siobhan on 087 2737812\r\n\r\nIntroducing No. 5 Roebuck Park, a fine, mature, detached property of approx. 206 sq m located in a prime gated residential development and boasting stunning surroundings. Available exclusively through Lynam Auctioneers, this delightful residence offers an exceptional opportunity for comfortable living and is perfectly positioned just a short stroll from a host of South Dublin's finest amenities.\r\n\r\nStepping through the attractive facade, No. 5  is a testament to thoughtful and tasteful decoration. This gem has been exquisitely updated and lovingly maintained by its current owners.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor accommodation comprises a spacious and welcoming entrance hallway, a downstairs WC, and an elegant living room leading to a modern kitchen. The kitchen itself is beautifully decorated and features a sleek cabinetry, modern appliances and a kitchen island, ideal for family dining and entertaining. Off the kitchen is a separate breakfast area as well as a most useful utility room. No 5 also boasts an additional family and dining room.\r\n\r\nOn the first floor there are 3 elegant and well appointed bedrooms, the master boasting an en suite bathroom. Accommodation is completed on this floor by a modern family bathroom. On the second floor are 2 more luxury bedrooms and a shower room.\r\n\r\nThis home boasts a highly convenient location and is within a short distance to both Dundrum and Goatstown villages. The Luas is only a 7 minute walk away and it is only a short walk to bus routes and easy access to the N11 and M50.  There are a host of primary and secondary schools close by to include Alexandra College, Gonzaga College, Our Lady’s Grove, Wesley College and Mount Anville as well as being in close vicinity to UCD and its leisure and sporting facilities. \r\n\r\nThis property offers the discerning purchaser a fantastic opportunity to live in a fabulous home, put down roots, and start creating lifelong memories.  No. 5 Roebuck Park offers an escape into tranquility yet being located in the heart of suburban Dublin. We recommend viewing as early as possible."
      },
